      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d8fcdfc3bdbea11e40f2ab5|full_name}: This has been a huge issue for me as well playing the game through SteamVR on my Oculus Rift S.  Started probably a month ago or so.  And it happens whether I use the Oculus overlay to access my virtual desktop or the SteamVR menu.  When I get back into the game, it runs like crap.  If I open the SteamVR menu, I can SEE the game running just fine behind the menu.  But when I close the menu, it's running like crap again.\nOne solution I found is to lower the render scale of the game in the SteamVR overlay to like 80%.  Then the game is suddenly running perfectly fine.  If you raise it back up it will run terribly again.  Only relaunching the game truly fixes it until it happens again some hours later...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
